  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Omprakash Hanuman Modi vs The State Of Maharashtra on 25 September, 2023 Author: N. J. Jamadar Bench: N. J. Jamadar 11-Aba-2682-23.Doc Sayali Upasani In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Anticipatory Bail Application No. 2682 Of 2023 Omprakash Hanuman Modi ...Applicant Versus The State of Maharashtra ...Respondent Mr. Meghashyam Kocharekar, for Applicant. Mr. M. G. Patil, App for State.",
    "facts": "2) This is an application for pre-arrest bail in connection with C.R. No. 91 of 2023, registered with Dadar Sagari police station, for the offences punishable under Sections 188, 272, 273, 328 read with Section 34 of Indian Penal Code, 1860 (\"the Penal Code\") and Sections 26(1), 26(2)(i), 26(2)(iv), 27(3)(d), 27(3) (e), 30(2)(a) and 59 of Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006. Omprakash Hanuman Modi vs The State Of Maharashtra on 25 September, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/115611178/ 1 1/3 11-ABA-2682-23.DOC 3) The applicant is alleged to be the supplier of the contraband article - Gutkha Pan Masala, which was found in possession of the co-accused, who has named the applicant as the supplier.",
